{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"历代志下","commonName":"历代志下","title":"历代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"11e64342757a4a6aa21c0c6299496e1b4d142c8a04944b979b3bf57868809712","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":821},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["圣殿的设备"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["他又制造一座铜坛，长二十肘，宽二十肘，高十肘；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["又铸一个铜海，样式是圆的，高五肘，径十肘，围三十肘；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["海周围有野瓜",{"noteId":0},"的样式，每肘十瓜，共有两行，是铸海的时候铸上的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["有十二只铜牛驮海：三只向北，三只向西，三只向南，三只向东；海在牛上，牛尾向内；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["海厚一掌，边如杯边，又如百合花，可容三千罢特；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又制造十个盆：五个放在右边，五个放在左边，献燔祭所用之物都洗在其内；但海是为祭司沐浴的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他又照所定的样式造十个金灯台放在殿里：五个在右边，五个在左边；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又造十张桌子放在殿里：五张在右边，五张在左边；又造一百个金碗；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又建立祭司院和大院，并院门，用铜包裹门扇；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["将海安在殿门的右边，就是南边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["户兰又造了盆、铲、碗。这样，他为所罗门王做完了 神殿的工。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["所造的就是：两根柱子和柱上两个如球的顶，并两个盖柱顶的网子"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["和四百石榴，安在两个网子上（每网两行盖着两个柱上如球的顶）。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["盆座和其上的盆，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["海和海下的十二只牛，"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["盆、铲子、肉锸子，与耶和华殿里的一切器皿，都是巧匠户兰用光亮的铜为所罗门王造成的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["是在约旦平原疏割和撒利但中间借胶泥铸成的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["所罗门制造的这一切甚多，铜的轻重无法可查。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["所罗门又造 神殿里的金坛和陈设饼的桌子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["并精金的灯台和灯盏，可以照例点在内殿前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["灯台上的花和灯盏，并蜡剪都是金的，且是纯金的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["又用精金制造镊子、盘子、调羹、火鼎。至于殿门和至圣所的门扇，并殿的门扇，都是金子妆饰的。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"野瓜：原文是牛","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}